# Token Economy

## Files
- Read only needed lines (offset/limit), not whole large files
- Grep/Glob first to locate, then read targeted sections
- Don't re-read files already in conversation unless edited

## Tools
- Batch independent tool calls in one message
- Grep for exact matches, SemanticSearch for meaning
- Native tools over shell commands for file ops

## Output
- No narrating comments in code
- Minimal StrReplace context — just enough for uniqueness
- Reference code by line numbers, don't reproduce

## Context
- Subagents for isolated exploration
- Don't repeat info already available in conversation

## Rules Authoring
- `alwaysApply: false` + precise `description` for conditional rules
- Bullet points over prose; under 50 lines per rule
- No duplication across rules

## Responses
- No preambles — answer directly
- Don't announce actions — just execute
- Concise results: outcome + next step
